{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5280910f-ac36-89f8-8ee7-241f3a5bb969",
  "created_at": "2026-01-08T08:58:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Susan Sherman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T08:55:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. Buenos días, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T08:55:57-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good morning. So, I'm Susan Sherman, and I've lived in the Point for, oh, twenty-some years, and it's always been a pretty quiet street, you know, a few cars, the occasional landscaper, nothing unusual. And I'm up early anyway, I get my coffee around five-thirty, so it's not like I'm trying to sleep in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T08:56:17-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T08:56:18-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "But since Monday, there's been a delivery truck parked out front of the building across from me, and the driver just leaves it idling. Dawn, every morning. Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, and again today. Diesel engine, rattling my windows, for like forty minutes at a time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T08:56:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ay, that's annoying. So you want to file a noise complaint?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T08:56:40-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's what I'm trying to figure out. I wasn't sure if it's you I should be telling or if I'm supposed to call the police non-emergency line instead. I didn't want to tie up the wrong people, because it's not an emergency, it's just, it's every single morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T08:56:58-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. For an ongoing thing like this, I can take down the complaint here and pass it along. And if the truck is there right now and it's bothering you, the non-emergency police line is fine for that too. Do you want me to take the details?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T08:57:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Hold on, let me grab, okay, I have a pen ready and a scrap of paper, so go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T08:57:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. What's the location of the truck?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T08:57:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the truck sits in front of the building across the street, but I'm at 137 Washington Street. That's me, the one calling. It's directly across from my front windows."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T08:57:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 137 Washington Street, and the truck is across from that. What time does it usually show up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T08:57:45-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Around six, a little before. And it's gone by quarter of seven or so. White box truck, I couldn't tell you the company, I haven't gone out in my robe to read the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T08:57:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Fair enough. And it's been Monday through today, so four mornings."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T08:58:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four mornings, yes. Honestly, if the driver just turned the engine off while he's unloading, I wouldn't care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T08:58:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll note that, and I'll put your number as the one you're calling from, or do you want to give a different one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T08:58:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0182. That's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T08:58:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0182. Someone will follow up, and if it happens again tomorrow, call the non-emergency line while the truck is there so an officer can see it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T08:58:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Okay. Well, thank you, Rosa. I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T08:58:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "De nada. Have a good day."
    }
  ],
